  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Metadata Transparency & Logic Refinement:\n      - Public Metadata Access: Exposed 'Position' properties for Body, First, Second, and Third parts of the HttpModel. This allows high-level services (e.g., FileStorage) to access raw buffer offsets and sizes for zero-copy Async I/O without compromising encapsulation.\n      - Standardized Cookie Logic: Fixed a semantic bug in TryGetCookie<T> where the lazy-indexing loop incorrectly referenced Header count instead of Cookie count.\n      - Enhanced Architecture: Reinforced the \"Internal Field / Public Property\" pattern to ensure high-performance internal modifications while maintaining read-only safety for external consumers.\n      - Optimization: Refined the integration between raw Buffer access and metadata-driven streaming, facilitating seamless wrapping of internal data into MemoryStream or ReadOnlyMemory.",
